					Comment for Type of Reporting Person:
				</div><div class="largetext" style="text-align:justify">Comment relating to row 13: Based upon 7,389,535 shares of common stock of the Issuer issued and outstanding, which 7,389,535 shares is equal to the sum of (i) 6,449,036 shares of common stock of the Issuer issued and outstanding as of December 18, 2024, as represented by the Issuer to Gilead Sciences, Inc. on December 18, 2024, plus (ii) 940,499 shares of common stock issued by the Issuer to Gilead Sciences, Inc. on December 19, 2024.</div></div></div><div class="form1"><table><tr><td class="center"><br><br><p><div align="center" style="font-size:1.2em;">
